<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77742" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάππος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>grandfather</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.55
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				447
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Nu.</u>
				65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				3.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ πάππου πατήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					856d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὁ πρὸς μητρὸς ἢ
			πατρός</span> on the mother's or father's side, ibid., cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				1628
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3332
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.16
			</span></i>: in pl., <i>grandparents</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2837b
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				p.1117
			</span></i>); also, generally, <i>ascendants, ancestors</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				174e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ πάππους δύο ἢ τρεῖς ἢ
				πλείους [ὁρίζεσθαι πολίτην</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1275b24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τρίτον π. ἀναφέρειν τὸ γένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					4.47
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυσάτω πάππους παρ᾽ ἡμῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					765
				</span></i>
			, with pun on signf. <i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i>, cf. Sch. ad loc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a character in Com. dramas, <u>Pantaloon</u>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.143
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>down on the seeds</i> of certain plants, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραίας ἀκάνθης π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					868
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀπ᾽ ἀκάνθης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					107.19
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				921
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Alex.</u>
				33
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκανθίς</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				25.168
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>first down on the chin</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύσταξ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1353.57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a small bird in whose
			nest the cuckoo lays (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπολαΐς</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				3.30
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				766
			</span></i>.</div>
